Original Project: PairDrop
Repository: https://github.com/schlagmichdoch/PairDrop
Original Author: schlagmichdoch and contributors
Original License: GPL-3.0

PairDrop itself is based on Snapdrop:
Repository: https://github.com/RobinLinus/snapdrop
Original Author: Robin Linus
Original License: GPL-3.0

================================================================================
MODIFICATIONS
================================================================================

January 2026 - Initial Rust Backend Rewrite
- Complete rewrite of the backend from Node.js to Rust
- Uses Axum web framework instead of Express.js
- Implements WebSocket signaling server in Rust
- Maintains full compatibility with original frontend
- Significantly reduced memory footprint (~2MB vs ~60MB)

The frontend code (public/) remains from the original PairDrop project
with minimal modifications.

